  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp-firstpass::Daniel.Master.DialogueData
  Language: EN
  Lines:
  - Hey you, I know you, you were with the labyrinth expedition earlier
  - Good to see that you are not hurt.
  - After the earthquake that happened earlier I lost everyone from the group.
  - Me and my band just wanted to go on a fun adventure but now they are lost somewhere
    in this labyrinth
  - I hope they are alright...
